      "prompt": "Construct the transformed exponential graph $f(x)={{a}}\\cdot {{base}}^{x-({{h}})}{{k|signed}}$. Plot the required points, then determine the horizontal asymptote, domain, range, and increasing/decreasing effect of the vertical reflection.",
      "functionSpec": {
